<title>CHILE: Chilectra SA year net rises.</title>
<headline>Chilectra SA year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electricity distributor Chilectra SA reported the following results for 1996.</p>
<p>				1996		   1995</p>
<p> Net earnings	     71.13		  56.09</p>
<p> Operating profit	 56.66		  44.75</p>
<p> Non-operating profit   25.85		  21.46</p>
<p> Total sales	     275.08		 271.79</p>
<p>(Figures are in billions of Chilean pesos)</p>
<p>NOTE: Chilectra is around 75-percent owned by power investment company Enersis.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago Newsroom, 562-599-5595x212))</p>
